Subject: element_segment vs element_line
Message-ID: <X0APk6UnJMY.2xBKubY6fosJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/X0APk6UnJMY/m/2xBKubY6fosJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

theme_segment is defined as follows ...

function (...)
{
    gg_dep("0.9.1", "theme_segment is deprecated. Use 'element_segment'
instead.")
    element_line(...)
}

  so if you try to use element_segment() as a replacement, you get an
error.  Should element_segment be replaced by element_line in the
deprecation message ... ?

  Ben Bolker

