Mike,

I see what you mean. Does it have something to do with your predictions? 180 is where your lines are wrapping around with coord_polar(). I wonder if when your predictions are calculated, the points are cut off at 180, and don't take into account points that will be immediately adjacent when polar coordinates are used.  Just a guess though. I don't use coord_polar much. :/

Brandon

