As a workaround, I'd suggest summarizing the data by hand using ddply:

library(plyr)
mtcars_m <- ddply(mtcars, c("cyl", "gear"), summarise, hp = mean(hp))

ggplot(mtcars, aes(cyl,hp, colour = factor(gear))) +
    geom_point() +
    geom_line(data=mtcars_m)

-Winston

