Dear list,

I am trying to plot relative frequencies and I cannot find the way to make such a plot. Please see the code I am using:

library(ggplot2)
df<-read.table(header=T, text=
'class year value
1 1996  2899
2 1996   213
3 1996   544
4 1996    45
6 1996   256
7 1996    10
1 1997  2787
2 1997   203
3 1997   542
4 1997    47
6 1997   255
7 1997    10
